 "structural_change": "MU-S81b 10-19: hardened master of the copy-A-only multi-user end-slice link endpoint for the stages with NO copy B (the 51 non-duplicated stage groups; host-less ends s_0S / s_0N / s_7S): new parameter-free top ot_s81sl_lep_mu_a = ot_s81sl_lep_core MU_EN 1, AB_EN 0, HOST_EN 0 (no host, l*_st or pair-B ports: no tied pad, no constant output). = s81sl_lepnh + user-tag TX window / RX strip (spare XB/XQ bits, 0 wires, 0 cycles) + landing port to dsdv_mu_land. Outline, 10 TX SRAM placement, W lane face and S clock/reset face = s81sl_lepnh; landing on N, ring + mu_c / mu_rt on E (as s81sl_lepmu). Faces: W 2,228 (4.69/um), N 2,211 (4.65/um), E 2,274 (4.79/um), S 4. Clock: region roots by 2-D k-means (clock_split_km.tcl, as s81sl_lepmu), K 8 for half the SRAM / flop mass.",
 "pin_regs": {
  "enable": false,
  "reason": "Source-registered as s81sl_lep / s81sl_lepnh (ro / li / ml_rd land in pin flops, ri / lo / ml_wd / mu_rt / fault leave flops); recipe pin_regs would add an unpriced stage."
 },
